            <ArticleTitle>Atypical pattern related to 14 Hz positive spikes.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>262-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We studied two children with a history of headache and a normal physical and neurological examination whose EEG showed an electroencephalographic pattern recently published, the N-shape potential associated with the 14 Hz positive spikes. This graphoelement was observed only during the asleep state.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
